I'm proud to introduce bipartisan legislation with Representative Luna to prevent federal elected officials from using campaign funds to go after survivors who bring claims of sexual assault or sexual harassment. Federal officials shouldn't be using donor money or money they raise for their own campaigns, to be having private investigators, go after survivors, or to defend themselves from very serious charges. I also appreciate Cheyenne Hunt's work in helping provide the leadership on these issues. We need a bipartisan majority for this bill to become law.
